# Tools the lint should skip — one slug per line, # for comments.
# Lint covers any top-level dir with an index.html that references
# /system/auth-guard.js. Public/standalone tools (no auth) are
# skipped automatically. Add a slug here to force-skip an authenticated
# tool that intentionally diverges from the template.
#
# Example:
#   some-tool    # single-use one-shot, doesn't follow the template
#
# (Genuinely disposable one-offs now live in /lab/, which is out of
#  lint scope entirely — no skip entry needed for those.)

portal    # landing page with bespoke auth flow; doesn't use nlAuthReady
